setting-component: government

Official Control: Elgari Authority Forestry and Extraction Office

Actual Governance:

Fragmented, barely functional

Each valley or highland region is ruled by a different structure—some corporate outposts, others co-ops, tribal elders, or revolutionary communes

The Council of Fog is a semi-mythical loose alliance of 13 local leaders who coordinate resistance against full Elgari control

Starbucks Presence:

No formal storefronts or branches

Agents operate via Jevin or Halor for indirect contact

Rostro is considered a “rogue influence zone” in Starbucks metrics, but its exports are too valuable to boycott
